[{"id":"app-testing-explicit-vs-implicit-wait","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"App测试","tags":["Appium","等待"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(十四)交互、等待与断言.md","articleTitle":"App测试(十四)交互、等待与断言","articlePath":"posts/2f02a034/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(十四)交互、等待与断言.md","articleTitle":"App测试(十四)交互、等待与断言","articlePath":"posts/2f02a034/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>显式等待和隐式等待应该怎样取舍？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>优先使用针对业务状态的显式等待，并明确全局隐式等待策略，避免两者叠加造成不可解释的超时。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>显式等待是针对某个条件等待，例如“提交按钮可点击”或“成功状态出现”；隐式等待则是 locator 查找失败时，在全局范围内统一重试一段时间。显式等待能表达业务状态，固定 sleep 与无边界重试只是在延迟失败。若必须使用隐式等待，要记录范围和时长，并通过延迟元素实验验证总耗时，避免两种等待叠加后不知道究竟等了多久。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-TR-006","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["TCP","SYN","超时"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/"}],"articleIndex":6,"articleCount":19,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>客户端持续重发 SYN 但收不到 SYN-ACK，能得出什么结论？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>只能说明握手响应没有按预期到达客户端；可能是路径丢弃、服务端不可达、策略静默丢弃或回程异常，需要抓包和路由证据区分。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>客户端只能确认“自己反复发出了 SYN，但没有按预期收到 SYN-ACK”，不能直接确认服务端进程已停止。两端都抓包时，若服务端看不到 SYN，优先检查路由、ACL、防火墙、接口或抓包位置；若服务端发出 SYN-ACK 但客户端收不到，继续查回程路径；若立即收到 RST，则更接近主动拒绝、端口未监听或中间设备重置。SYN 超时和 RST 的失败边界不同，不能统称为“端口不通”。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a6-apt-dpkg","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["APT","dpkg"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(六)用户权限与软件管理.md","articleTitle":"Linux(六)用户权限与软件管理","articlePath":"posts/5a63b164/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(六)用户权限与软件管理.md","articleTitle":"Linux(六)用户权限与软件管理","articlePath":"posts/5a63b164/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":5,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>apt-cache、apt-get —simulate 和 dpkg 分别提供什么证据？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>apt-cache 看索引和候选版本，apt-get —simulate 预演依赖变化，dpkg 查询已安装包和文件归属。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>三种证据分别回答“仓库知道什么、如果安装会发生什么、当前本机装了什么”：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">apt-cache policy bash\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">apt-get --simulate install bash\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">dpkg -s bash\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">dpkg -L bash | \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">head\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>只有模拟计划和来源符合预期时才进入真实安装；\u003ccode>dpkg -s\u003c/code> 也不能证明服务已启动，运行状态应再用 \u003ccode>systemctl is-active\u003c/code> 或实际健康检查验证。RHEL 系则用 \u003ccode>dnf --assumeno\u003c/code> 预演、\u003ccode>rpm -q\u003c/code> 查询，不要把两套包数据库的输出混为一谈。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-xdist-session-fixture","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["并行 Fixture"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(十)并行执行与稳定性.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(十)并行执行与稳定性","articlePath":"posts/5497f9c8/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(十)并行执行与稳定性.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(十)并行执行与稳定性","articlePath":"posts/5497f9c8/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么 session Fixture 在 xdist 下仍可能执行多次？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>session 作用域只覆盖一个 worker 进程；多个 worker 各自建立自己的 session 实例。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>session\u003c/code> 的缓存边界是一个 worker 进程，而不是整个 xdist 运行。四个 worker 会得到四个彼此独立的 Python 解释器，也就有四份 session Fixture：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">@pytest.fixture(\u003cspan class=\"params\">scope=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;session&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">worker_cache\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">tmp_path_factory, worker_id\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    path = tmp_path_factory.mktemp(\u003cspan class=\"string\">f&quot;cache-\u003cspan class=\"subst\">&#123;worker_id&#125;\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> path\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>如果资源必须全局只初始化一次，就需要外部可协调系统或带锁、幂等和结果校验的初始化协议。普通测试数据应接受“每个 worker 一份”，不要尝试跨进程共享 Python 对象。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-advanced-descriptor","type":"basic","priority":3,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","descriptor","property","属性查找"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十一)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Python(十一)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/a99f76bc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十一)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Python(十一)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/a99f76bc/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>描述符是什么？它和 property 有什么关系？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>描述符是定义 \u003ccode>__get__\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>__set__\u003c/code> 或 \u003ccode>__delete__\u003c/code> 的对象；property 是建立在描述符协议上的常见封装。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>描述符把属性读写变成可复用协议：当类属性实现 \u003ccode>__get__\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>__set__\u003c/code> 或 \u003ccode>__delete__\u003c/code> 时，实例访问会交给它处理。\u003ccode>property\u003c/code> 是最常见的封装：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">9\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">10\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">11\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">12\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">13\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">class\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title class_\">User\u003c/span>:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">__init__\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">self, age\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        \u003cspan class=\"variable language_\">self\u003c/span>._age = age\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">    @property\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">age\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">self\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"variable language_\">self\u003c/span>._age\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">    @age.setter\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">age\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">self, value\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">if\u003c/span> value &lt; \u003cspan class=\"number\">0\u003c/span>:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">            \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">raise\u003c/span> ValueError(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;age must be non-negative&quot;\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        \u003cspan class=\"variable language_\">self\u003c/span>._age = value\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>普通业务代码优先使用 \u003ccode>property\u003c/code>；只有多类、多字段需要同一访问规则时才自定义描述符。它控制的是属性协议，不是安全隔离，仍需在公开入口做权限和数据校验。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-scenario-search-filter","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["场景","搜索筛选"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(六)功能测试用例设计.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(六)功能测试用例设计","articlePath":"posts/cd81672d/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(六)功能测试用例设计.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(六)功能测试用例设计","articlePath":"posts/cd81672d/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":7,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>给定搜索结果筛选，如何设计功能测试用例？先澄清需求，再给出方法、数据、步骤和预期。\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>用可枚举的商品夹具覆盖有结果、无结果和组合筛选，直接比较期望商品集合、计数、排序和页码。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>教学假设：筛选条件按 AND 组合，排序和缺省值已定义。准备确定的商品集合，先验证关键词命中集合，再验证一个筛选条件和多个条件的交集；输入不存在的关键词时，显示空状态且计数为 0；切换筛选后检查结果集合、页码和总数是否按规则更新。不要只看“列表有内容”，也要核对边界值、重复商品、排序稳定性。追问快速输入、清空筛选和切换条件是否重置页码。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-scenario-after-sale-journey","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["场景","售后","退款"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练","articlePath":"posts/c75ad281/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练","articlePath":"posts/c75ad281/"}],"articleIndex":12,"articleCount":14,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>如何测试退款售后完整流程？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>沿申请、审核、退货、退款状态覆盖拒绝后修改、重复请求、部分退款和金额记录一致性。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>教学流程使用合成订单和虚拟支付，不引用真实法律时限。代表用例检查申请条件、审核拒绝后是否可补充、退货记录、部分退款上限、重复退款幂等和余额/原支付匹配。售后期间订单其他商品的处理需要追问，不能把一个退款成功当作整单状态正确。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]